<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Becksham offer to Minvest unconditional.</title>
<headline>Becksham offer to Minvest unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Messina Investments Ltd Minvest) said on Wednesday the offer by Barbados-based Becksham Corp to buy all Minvest's shares has become unconditional following acceptances by holders of more than 90 percent of the offer shares.</p>
<p>It said further that a special dividend of 21.34 a share will be paid to Minvest shareholders following the disposal of its holding in Van Oudtshoornstroom Coal Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
